    "collapsible-rows-1": {
      "type": "collapsible-rows",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Hyaluronic Acid",
            "description": "<p>A powerful humectant, hyaluronic acid attracts moisture to the skin, helping it retain hydration. It's known for its ability to plump the skin, reducing the appearance of fine lines and wrinkles, and making the skin look and feel more supple.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Retinol (Vitamin A)",
            "description": "<p>Retinol is celebrated for its anti-aging properties. It promotes skin renewal, enhances collagen production, and helps to reduce the appearance of fine lines, wrinkles, and age spots. Its regular use can lead to smoother, firmer, and more evenly toned skin.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Vitamin C",
            "description": "<p>As a potent antioxidant, Vitamin C protects the skin from damage caused by free radicals and sun exposure. It also brightens the skin, reduces hyperpigmentation, and boosts collagen production, contributing to a radiant and youthful complexion.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-4": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Niacinamide (Vitamin B3)",
            "description": "<p>Niacinamide is known for its versatility in skincare. It improves skin texture, diminishes pores, helps in managing acne and redness, and also evens out skin tone. It strengthens the skin’s barrier function, improving its overall health and appearance.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-5": {
          "type": "collapsible-row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Salicylic Acid",
            "description": "<p>Particularly beneficial for acne-prone skin, salicylic acid is a beta-hydroxy acid that exfoliates the skin, helping to clear clogged pores and reduce breakouts. It also has anti-inflammatory properties, making it effective in calming irritated skin and reducing redness.</p>",
            "page-content": "",
            "default-open": false
          }
        }
      },
