            "description": "<p>For optimal results with<strong> </strong><strong>{{ product.title }}</strong>, begin by cleansing your face. Apply a small amount of the product evenly across your skin, focusing on areas needing extra care. Gently massage in upward, circular motions until fully absorbed. Use twice daily, in the morning and evening, for best results. <br/><br/>If applying in the morning, follow up with sunscreen to protect skin from UV damage. Suitable for daily use and all skin types. For sensitive skin, consider a patch test before the first use. Consistent application is key to achieving and maintaining the desired skin benefits.</p>",
            "mobile-hide-enabled": false
          }
